WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.268
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.268 --> 00:00:03.770
This is "Late Night."
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:03.770 --> 00:00:05.972
And now, if you don't mind,
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:05.972 --> 00:00:08.474
Republicans yesterday
elected Mike Johnson

00:00:08.474 --> 00:00:10.810
the 56th Speaker of the House,

00:00:10.810 --> 00:00:12.745
which is crazy
because a month ago,

00:00:12.745 --> 00:00:14.414
we were only at 12.

00:00:14.414 --> 00:00:16.549
[ Laughter ]

00:00:16.549 --> 00:00:18.384
Politico published
a new profile today

00:00:18.384 --> 00:00:20.153
about House speaker
Mike Johnson, titled

00:00:20.153 --> 00:00:23.255
"55 Things You Need to Know
About Mike Johnson."

00:00:23.255 --> 00:00:25.625
55?!

00:00:25.625 --> 00:00:28.127
I don't know 55 things
about my wife.

00:00:28.127 --> 00:00:29.529
[ Laughter ]

00:00:29.529 --> 00:00:33.132
I don't think there are
55 things about Mike Johnson.

00:00:33.132 --> 00:00:37.203
What's number 55 on the list?
He's not allergic to cilantro?

00:00:37.203 --> 00:00:39.138
[ Laughter ]

00:00:39.138 --> 00:00:41.574
Workers at the Capitol yesterday
hung a sign

00:00:41.574 --> 00:00:44.411
above the speaker's office
for House Speaker Mike Johnson,

00:00:44.411 --> 00:00:47.247
instead of what Johnson wanted
to hang in the Capitol building,

00:00:47.247 --> 00:00:48.214
Mike Pence.

00:00:48.214 --> 00:00:52.886
[ Laughter ]

00:00:52.886 --> 00:00:56.088
Judge Arthur Engoron
fined former president

00:00:56.088 --> 00:00:59.358
Trump $10,000 yesterday
for violating his gag order.

00:00:59.358 --> 00:01:00.527
Said Trump, "Here's 20.

00:01:00.527 --> 00:01:02.462
I just posted
your address on Instagram."

00:01:02.462 --> 00:01:04.797
[ Laughter ]

00:01:04.797 --> 00:01:07.166
The United Auto Workers
announced yesterday

00:01:07.166 --> 00:01:10.403
that the union has reached
a tentative agreement with Ford.

00:01:10.403 --> 00:01:13.840
Though Ford still hasn't managed
to reach a deal with Calvin.

00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:18.844
[ Laughter ]

00:01:18.844 --> 00:01:21.113
Authorities in Orlando
recently arrested a man

00:01:21.113 --> 00:01:22.782
who allegedly
robbed a pharmacy

00:01:22.782 --> 00:01:24.750
and demanded bottles
of prescription drugs,

00:01:24.750 --> 00:01:25.951
including Viagra.

00:01:25.951 --> 00:01:28.321
The robber didn't have a weapon,
but now he does.

00:01:28.321 --> 00:01:33.726
[ Laughter ]

00:01:33.726 --> 00:01:37.130
Italian Prime Minister Giorgia
Meloni announced yesterday

00:01:37.130 --> 00:01:39.999
that she has split
from her boyfriend of a decade

00:01:39.999 --> 00:01:42.301
after an audio
recording surfaced of him

00:01:42.301 --> 00:01:45.939
inviting a woman
to join him in group sex.

00:01:45.939 --> 00:01:47.807
And he would have
gotten away with it, too,

00:01:47.807 --> 00:01:49.342
if he hadn't identified himself.

00:01:49.342 --> 00:01:51.311
-It's a-me, Mario.

00:01:51.311 --> 00:01:58.083
[ Laughter ]

00:01:58.083 --> 00:01:59.585
-You know, every now
and then we get criticized

00:01:59.585 --> 00:02:01.420
for not doing stories
about international news,

00:02:01.420 --> 00:02:03.222
but I think we have
a very nuanced take.

00:02:03.222 --> 00:02:06.793
[ Laughter ]

00:02:06.793 --> 00:02:09.095
KFC unveiled two new wraps
this week,

00:02:09.095 --> 00:02:11.797
including a fried chicken
and mac and cheese option.

00:02:11.797 --> 00:02:14.901
And if you eat them both, you
can get a third wrap for free.

00:02:14.901 --> 00:02:20.607
[ Laughter ]

00:02:20.607 --> 00:02:22.274
And finally, in honor
of Halloween,

00:02:22.274 --> 00:02:25.478
select Chipotle locations
will stay open until midnight.

00:02:25.478 --> 00:02:29.382
And to make it extra scary,
the bathroom closes at 10.

00:02:29.382 --> 00:02:31.384
[ Laughter ]

00:02:31.384 --> 00:02:33.119
And that was a monologue,
everybody.

00:02:33.119 --> 00:02:39.158
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:39.158 --> 00:02:42.695
Before we move on tonight,
I just want to say something.

00:02:42.695 --> 00:02:44.330
As you no doubt know by now,

00:02:44.330 --> 00:02:46.466
there was yet another mass
shooting last night,

00:02:46.466 --> 00:02:49.268
this time in the town
of Lewiston, Maine.

00:02:49.268 --> 00:02:51.737
On this show, we make jokes
about everything --

00:02:51.737 --> 00:02:53.673
human stupidity,
governmental chaos.

00:02:53.673 --> 00:02:55.174
We even make jokes about evil.

00:02:55.174 --> 00:02:58.444
But it is exceedingly difficult
to find a way to talk

00:02:58.444 --> 00:03:01.513
about tragedy in the face
of events like these.

00:03:01.513 --> 00:03:06.152
You really come right up
against the impotence of words.

00:03:06.152 --> 00:03:07.786
All I can say
is we are deeply saddened

00:03:07.786 --> 00:03:11.524
by the loss of life in Lewiston
and the loss of life in Israel

00:03:11.524 --> 00:03:14.427
and Gaza and Ukraine
and countless other places.

00:03:14.427 --> 00:03:17.664
We continue to wish for peace
for every community

00:03:17.664 --> 00:03:19.332
living under the constant
threat of violence,

00:03:19.332 --> 00:03:22.735
which tragically seems
to be every community,

00:03:22.735 --> 00:03:25.338
we're going to try to move on
and have a good time tonight.

00:03:25.338 --> 00:03:27.574
But thank you so much
for hearing me out.

